  "description": "Han Bom has had a weak heart since childhood. Even though she lives with the fear of never knowing when she might die, she always tries to live every moment of her life happily. However, even after reaching adulthood, she has never experienced true love or an intimate relationship. When she is betrayed by her first boyfriend, she makes an impulsive decision. \n\n“Then I’d rather have my first time with the most amazing man I can find.” \n\nThe man who catches Bom’s eye is Tae Sinyu, her older brother’s friend, whom she has known since childhood.     \n\n“Oppa, do you have a girlfriend?”    \n“No.”     \n“Then sleep with me.”\n\n**Original Webtoon:**   \n[Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=14175279), [Ridibooks](https://ridibooks.com/books/3885051427)",
